{"id":"a7b1b75a0e18bc22","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations.md","title":"thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations","display":"thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations","aliases":["56-thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations"],"display":"thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations","depends_on":["[[56-df-interpretation-order]]","[[56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations]]","[[56-df-satisfaction]]","[[56-thm-interpretation-termination]]"],"source_section":"6.2.8","source_pages":"187","source_ocr_blocks":[208],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a92e0473734a9033\" href=\"?note=a92e0473734a9033\" title=\"56-df-interpretation-order\">56-df-interpretation-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f6bf69669f54adda\" href=\"?note=f6bf69669f54adda\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations\">56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1a2313edea993f6b\" href=\"?note=1a2313edea993f6b\" title=\"56-thm-interpretation-termination\">56-thm-interpretation-termination</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.2.8"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"187"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>208</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq T^2\">\\(E\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_{R/E}\">\\(\\to_{R/E}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f6bf69669f54adda\" href=\"?note=f6bf69669f54adda\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations\">56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations</a> 的等价—一步—等价关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A,I,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A,I,E)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a>，表示 I 解释下所有赋值满足 E。载体存在量词在集合论元语言中遍历非空集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}\">\\(\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq A^2\">\\(Q\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>。模型谓词和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a92e0473734a9033\" href=\"?note=a92e0473734a9033\" title=\"56-df-interpretation-order\">56-df-interpretation-order</a> 的诱导解释序都在合格代数上求值；基本解释终止接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1a2313edea993f6b\" href=\"?note=1a2313edea993f6b\" title=\"56-thm-interpretation-termination\">56-thm-interpretation-termination</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_{R/E})\\iff\n\\exists A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\exists I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq A^2\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A,I,E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,&gt;_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V})\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_{R/E})\\iff\n\\exists A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\exists I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq A^2\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A,I,E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,&gt;_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V})\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Theorem 6.2.8。由等式模型，E 转换保持所有解释值；R 步使解释值严格下降，因此排除无限 R/E 链。反向用 A=T/≡E，构造项运算的商及模等价改写的传递闭包序；等式同余保证代表元无关，模终止保证良基。已读原书 p.187 的证明，并核对这里 R/E 是两侧均允许 E 等价的定义。不能把仅存在任意 E 模型当作终止依据，还需兼容的良基逐参数单调序。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.2.8，印刷页 187。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-interpretation-order","status":"resolved","id":"a92e0473734a9033","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-interpretation-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations","status":"resolved","id":"f6bf69669f54adda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rew